<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CUENTA / CONFIGURACIÓN</div><h1>Mi <em>perfil</em></h1><p>Actualiza tu información de usuario y contraseña.</p></div></div><section class="panel narrow"><div class="profile-intro"><span class="avatar big"><?=e(mb_strtoupper(mb_substr($profile['nickname_valorant'],0,1)))?></span><div><h2><?=e($profile['nickname_valorant'])?></h2><p>Rol actual: <span class="chip"><?=e(['1'=>'Coach','2'=>'Titular','3'=>'Suplente','4'=>'Parche','5'=>'Tryout'][(string)$profile['id_rol']]??'Jugador')?></span></p><p>Rol competitivo principal: <span class="chip"><?=e(UsuarioModel::byId((int)$profile['id_usuario'])['id_rol_competitivo'] ? (function()use($profile){foreach(UsuarioModel::rolesCompetitivos() as $r)if((int)$r['id_rol_competitivo']===(int)$profile['id_rol_competitivo'])return $r['nombre_rol_competitivo'];return 'Sin asignar';})() : 'Sin asignar')?></span></p></div></div><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('perfil-guardar'))?>" class="form-stack"><?=csrfField()?><label>Nombre completo<input name="nombre_completo" value="<?=e($profile['nombre_completo'])?>" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Nickname<input name="nickname_valorant" value="<?=e($profile['nickname_valorant'])?>" maxlength="50" required></label><label>Correo electrónico<input type="email" name="email" value="<?=e($profile['email'])?>" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Nueva contraseña <small>(dejar vacía para no cambiarla)</small><input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"></label><div><button class="btn btn-primary">Guardar cambios →</button></div></form></section>
